e of potential uchronistic events is seriously established.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608900/extras/44762c708c60f1fd595589d4d3fe8edd.avif?t=1752109772\" width=616 height=80 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608900/extras/983d6aff2cbf47cb55ad1eb5a63fd691.poster.avif?t=1752109772\" width=616 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608900/extras/983d6aff2cbf47cb55ad1eb5a63fd691.webm?t=1752109772\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2608900/extras/983d6aff2cbf47cb55ad1eb5a63fd691.mp4?t=1752109772\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Avant-Garde will have a simple, concise tutorial, to ensure that every player understands how the game mechanics work. Two attack modes will be available: automatic attack and precise attack. So whether you're a beginner or an expert, the field of glory is within your grasp.</p>",
